{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-001", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "狌狌", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如禺而白耳，伏行人走，其名曰狌狌，食之善走。", "tags": ["bipedal_gait", "body_ape", "fast_runner"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-004#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-004", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "鹿蜀", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如馬而白首，其文如虎而赤尾，其音如謠，其名曰鹿蜀，佩之宜子孫。", "tags": ["body_horse", "head_white", "sound_human", "striped", "tail_red", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-005", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鯥", "text": "有魚焉，其狀如牛，陵居，蛇尾有翼，其羽在魼下，其音如留牛，其名曰鯥，冬死而夏生，食之無腫疾。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "dormancy", "on_land", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-006", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "類", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狸而有髦，其名曰類，自為牝牡，食者不妬。", "tags": ["body_wildcat", "mane"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-007", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "猼訑", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如羊，九尾四耳，其目在背，其名曰猼訑，佩之不畏。", "tags": ["body_sheep", "tails_many"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-007#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-007", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "𪁺𩿧", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雞而三首六目、六足三翼，其名曰𪁺𩿧，食之無臥。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "heads_many", "legs_six", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-008", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "有獸焉", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狐而九尾，其音如嬰兒，能食人；食者不蠱。", "tags": ["body_fox", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "tails_many", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-1-008#3", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-1-008", "book": "南山經", "section": "南山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "赤鱬", "text": "其中多赤鱬，其狀如魚而人面，其音如鴛鴦，食之不疥。", "tags": ["body_fish", "human_face", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-2-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-2-001", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "貍力", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豚，有距，其音如狗吠，其名曰貍力，見則其縣多土功。", "tags": ["body_pig", "sound_dog", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-2-001#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-2-001", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鴸", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鴟而人手。其音如痺，其名曰鴸，名自號也，見則其縣多放放士。", "tags": ["body_owl", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-2-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-2-003", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "猾褢", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如人而彘鬛，穴居而冬蟄，其名曰猾褢，其音如斲木，見則縣有大繇。", "tags": ["body_human", "burrow", "dormancy", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-2-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-2-007", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "彘", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如虎而牛尾，其音如吠犬，其名曰彘，是食人。苕水出于其陰，北流注于具區。其中多鮆魚。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_bigcat", "man_eater", "sound_dog", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-2-016#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-2-016", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "蠱雕", "text": "有獸焉，名曰蠱雕，其狀如雕而有角，其音如嬰兒之音，是食人。", "tags": ["body_bird", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-3-002#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-3-002", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "瞿如", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鵁，而白首、三足、人面，其名曰瞿如，其鳴自號也。", "tags": ["head_white", "human_face", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-3-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-3-003", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鳳皇", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雞，五采而文，名曰鳳皇，首文曰德，翼文曰義，背文曰禮，膺文曰仁，腹文曰信。是鳥也，飲食自然，自歌自舞，見則天下安寧。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "five_colours", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-01-3-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-01-3-010", "book": "南山經", "section": "南次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "顒", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如梟，人面四目而有耳，其名曰顒，其鳴自號也，見則天下大旱。", "tags": ["body_owl", "human_face", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-002#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-002", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "䳋渠", "text": "有鳥焉，其名曰䳋渠，其狀如山雞，黑身赤足，可以已𦢊。", "tags": ["body_black", "body_fowl", "body_red"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-003", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "snake", "name_display_only": "肥𧔥", "text": "有蛇焉，名曰肥𧔥，六足四翼，見則天下大旱。", "tags": ["legs_six", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-007#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-007", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "肥遺", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鶉，黃身而赤喙，其名曰肥遺，食之已癘，可以殺蟲。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_fowl"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-008", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "毫彘", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豚而白毛，大如笄而黑端，名曰毫彘。", "tags": ["body_pig", "quills"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-010", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "嚻", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如禺而長臂，善投，其名曰嚻。", "tags": ["body_ape", "long_arms", "throws"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-010#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-010", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "有鳥焉", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如梟，人面而一足，曰橐𩇯，冬見夏蟄，服之不畏雷。", "tags": ["body_owl", "dormancy", "human_face", "leg_one"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-016#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-016", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "𤣎如", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如鹿而白尾，馬腳人手而四角，名曰𤣎如。", "tags": ["body_deer", "horns_four"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-017#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-017", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "有獸焉", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛，而蒼黑大目，其狀曰𤛎。", "tags": ["body_black", "body_cattle"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-1-017#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-1-017", "book": "西山經", "section": "西山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鸚䳇", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鴞，青羽赤喙，人舌能言，名曰鸚䳇。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_owl", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-2-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-2-005", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鸞鳥", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如翟而五采文，名曰鸞鳥，見則天下安寧。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "five_colours"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-2-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-2-007", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鳧徯", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雄雞而人面，名曰鳧徯，其鳴自叫也，見則有兵。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "human_face", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-2-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-2-009", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "朱厭", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如猿，而白首赤足，名曰朱厭，見則大兵。", "tags": ["body_ape", "head_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-001", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "舉父", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如禺而文臂，豹虎而善投，名曰舉父。", "tags": ["body_ape", "long_arms", "throws"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-001#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-001", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "蠻蠻", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鳧，而一翼一目，相得乃飛，名曰蠻蠻，見則天下大水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_duck", "eye_one", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-005", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "unknown", "name_display_only": "其子曰皷", "text": "。其子曰皷，其狀如人面而龍身，是與欽䲹殺葆江于昆侖之陽，帝乃戮之鍾山之東曰𡺯崖。欽䲹化為大鶚，其狀如雕而黑文白首，赤喙而虎爪，其音如晨鵠，見則有大兵；鼓亦化為鵕鳥，其狀如鴟，赤足而直喙，黃文而白首，其音如鵠，見則其邑大旱。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_human", "body_owl", "head_white", "human_face", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-006", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "文鰩魚", "text": "是多文鰩魚，狀如鯉魚，魚身而鳥翼，蒼文而白首，赤喙，常從西海遊于東海，以夜飛。其音如鸞雞，其味酸甘，食之已狂，見則天下大穰。", "tags": ["beak_red", "blue_green", "body_fish", "flies_night", "head_white", "marine", "nocturnal", "sea_migration", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-008", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "土螻", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如羊而四角，名曰土螻，是食人。", "tags": ["body_sheep", "horns_four", "man_eater"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-009", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "䱻魚", "text": "其中多䱻魚，其狀如蛇而四足，是食魚。", "tags": ["body_snake", "elongated_four_legged", "legs_four"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-011#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-011", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "unknown", "name_display_only": "西王母", "text": "。西王母其狀如人，豹尾虎齒而善嘯，蓬髪戴勝，是司天之厲及五殘。", "tags": ["body_human", "tusks", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-011#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-011", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "狡", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如犬而豹文，其角如牛，其名曰狡，其音如吠犬，見則其國大穰。", "tags": ["body_dog", "sound_dog", "spotted", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-015#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-015", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "有獸焉", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如赤豹，五尾一角，其音如擊石，其名如猙。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "horn_one", "sound_drum", "tails_many", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-015#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-015", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "畢方", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鶴，一足，赤文青質而白喙，名曰畢方，其鳴自叫也，見則其邑有譌火。", "tags": ["body_crane", "leg_one", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-016#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-016", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "天狗", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狸而白首，名曰天狗，其音如榴榴，可以禦凶。", "tags": ["body_wildcat", "head_white", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-018#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-018", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "𢕟𢓨", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛，白身四角，其豪如披蓑，其名曰𢕟𢓨，是食人。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "body_white", "horns_four", "long_shaggy_hair", "man_eater"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-022#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-022", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "讙", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狸，一目而三尾，名曰讙，其音如奪百聲，是可以禦凶，服之已癉。", "tags": ["body_wildcat", "eye_one", "tails_many", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-3-022#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-3-022", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鵸鵌", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如烏，三首六尾而善笑，名曰鵸鵌，服之使人不厭，又可以禦凶。", "tags": ["body_crow", "heads_many", "sound_human", "tails_many"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-4-016#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-4-016", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "駮", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如馬而白身黑尾，一角，虎牙爪，音如鼓音，其名曰駮，是食虎豹，可以禦兵。", "tags": ["body_black", "body_horse", "body_white", "horn_one", "sound_drum", "tusks", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-4-017#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-4-017", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "窮奇", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛，猬毛，名曰窮奇，音如獆狗，是食人。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "man_eater", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-4-018#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-4-018", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鰠魚", "text": "其中多鰠魚，其狀如鱣魚，動則其邑有大兵。濫水出于其西，西流注于漢水，多𩶯魮之魚，其狀如覆銚，鳥首而魚翼魚尾，音如磬石之聲，是生珠玉。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_fish", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-4-019#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-4-019", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "孰湖", "text": "有獸焉，其狀馬身而鳥翼，人面蛇尾，是好舉人，名曰孰湖。", "tags": ["body_horse", "human_face", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-02-4-019#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-02-4-019", "book": "西山經", "section": "西次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "有鳥焉", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鴞而人面，蜼身犬尾，其名自號也，見則其邑大旱。", "tags": ["body_ape", "body_owl", "human_face", "self_named_call"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-002#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-002", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "水馬", "text": "其中多水馬，其狀如馬，文臂牛尾，其音如呼。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_horse", "long_arms", "sound_human", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-003", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "䑏疏", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如馬，一角有錯，其名曰䑏疏，可以辟火。", "tags": ["body_horse", "horn_one"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-003#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-003", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鵸䳜", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如烏，五采而赤文，名曰鵸䳜，是自爲牝牡，食之不疽。", "tags": ["body_crow", "five_colours"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-003#3", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-003", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "儵魚", "text": "其中多儵魚，其狀如鶏而赤毛，三尾六足四首，其音如鵲，食之可以已憂。", "tags": ["legs_six", "tails_many", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-005", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鰼鰼之魚", "text": "其中多鰼鰼之魚，其狀如鵲而十翼，鱗皆在羽端，其音如鵲，可以禦火，食之不癉。其上多松柏，其下多椶枏，其獸多麢羊，其鳥多蕃。", "tags": ["body_crow", "scales", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-008", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "耳鼠", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如鼠，而菟首麋身，其音如獆犬，以其尾飛，名曰耳鼠，食之不䐆，又可以禦百毒。", "tags": ["body_deer", "body_rat", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-009", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "孟極", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豹，而文題白身，名曰孟極，是善伏，其鳴自呼。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "body_white", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-010", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "幽鴳", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如禺而文身，善笑，見人則臥，名曰幽鴳，其鳴自呼。", "tags": ["body_ape", "self_named_call", "sound_human", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-011#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-011", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "足訾", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如禺而有鬛，牛尾、文臂、馬蹏，見人則呼，名曰足訾，其鳴自呼。", "tags": ["body_ape", "long_arms", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-011#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-011", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鵁", "text": "有鳥焉，群居而朋飛，其毛如雌雉，名曰鵁，其鳴自呼，食之已風。", "tags": ["long_shaggy_hair", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-012#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-012", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "諸犍", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豹而長尾，人首而牛耳，一目，名曰諸犍，善吒，行則銜其尾。居則蟠其尾。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "eye_one", "human_face", "long_tail"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-012#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-012", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "白鵺", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雉，而文首、白翼、黃足，名曰白鵺，食之已嗌痛，可以已痸。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-013#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-013", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "竦斯", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雌雉而人面，見人則躍，名曰竦斯，其鳴自呼也。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "human_face", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-018#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-018", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "窫窳", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛，而赤身、人面、馬足，名曰窫窳，其音如嬰兒，是食人。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "body_red", "human_face", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-019#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-019", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "有獸焉", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如犬而人面，善投，見人則笑，其名山𤟤，其行如風，見則天下大風。", "tags": ["body_dog", "human_face", "sound_human", "throws"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-1-020#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-1-020", "book": "北山經", "section": "北山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "諸懷", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛，而四角、人目、彘耳，其名曰諸懷，其音如鳴鴈，是食人。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "horns_four", "man_eater", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-2-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-2-010", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "狍鴞", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如羊身人面，其目在腋下，虎齒人爪，其音如嬰兒，名曰狍鴞，是食人。", "tags": ["body_human", "body_sheep", "human_face", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "tusks", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-2-011#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-2-011", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "獨𤞞", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如虎，而白身犬首，馬尾彘鬛，名曰獨𤞞。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "body_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-2-011#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-2-011", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "𪄀𪃑", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如烏，人面，名曰𪄀𪃑，宵飛而晝伏，食之已暍。", "tags": ["body_crow", "human_face"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-2-012#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-2-012", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "嚻", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如夸父，四翼、一目、犬尾，名曰嚻，其音如鵲，食之已腹痛，可以止衕。", "tags": ["eye_one", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-001", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "䮝", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如麢羊而四角，馬尾而有距，其名曰䮝，善還，其名自訆。", "tags": ["body_deer", "body_sheep", "horns_four", "self_named_call"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-001#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-001", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "䴅", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鵲，白身、赤尾、六足，其名曰䴅，是善驚，其鳴自詨。", "tags": ["body_crow", "body_white", "legs_six", "self_named_call", "tail_red", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-002#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-002", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "人魚", "text": "其中多人魚，其狀如䱱魚，四足，其音如嬰兒，食之無癡疾。", "tags": ["body_fish", "legs_four", "sound_baby", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-003", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "天馬", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如白犬而黑頭，見人則飛，其名曰天馬，其鳴自訆，", "tags": ["body_dog", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-003#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-003", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鶌鶋", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如烏，首白而身青、足黃，是名曰鶌鶋。其名自詨，食之不饑，可以已寓。", "tags": ["body_crow", "self_named_call"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-006", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "領胡", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛而尾，其頸𦜜，其狀如句瞿，其名曰領胡，其鳴自詨，食之已狂。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-006#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-006", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "象蛇", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雌雉，而五采以文，是自爲牝牡，名曰象蛇，其鳴自詨。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "five_colours", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-010", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "酸與", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如蛇，而四翼、六目、三足，名曰酸與，其鳴自詨，見則其邑有恐。", "tags": ["body_snake", "self_named_call", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-018#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-018", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "黃鳥", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如梟而白首，其名曰黃鳥，其鳴自詨，食之不妒。", "tags": ["body_owl", "head_white", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-022#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-022", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "精衛", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如烏，文首、白喙、赤足，名曰精衛，其鳴自詨。是炎帝之少女，名曰女娃，女娃游于東海，溺而不返，故為精衛，常銜西山之木石，以堙于東海。", "tags": ["body_crow", "marine", "sea_migration", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-034#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-034", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "䍶䍶", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如羊，一角一目，目在耳後，其名曰䍶䍶，其鳴自訆。", "tags": ["body_sheep", "eye_one", "horn_one", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-03-3-042#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-03-3-042", "book": "北山經", "section": "北次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "獂", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛而三足，其名曰獂，其鳴自詨。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-1-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-1-003", "book": "東山經", "section": "東山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "從從", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如犬，六足，其名曰從從，其鳴自詨。", "tags": ["body_dog", "legs_six", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-1-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-1-010", "book": "東山經", "section": "東山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "𧌁䗤", "text": "其中多𧌁䗤，其狀如黃蛇，魚翼，出入有光，見則其邑大旱。", "tags": ["body_snake", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-1-011#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-1-011", "book": "東山經", "section": "東山經之首", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "狪狪", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豚而有珠，名曰狪狪，其鳴自訆。", "tags": ["body_pig", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-001", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "軨軨", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛而虎文，其音如欽。其名曰軨軨，其鳴自訆，見則天下大水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_cattle", "self_named_call", "striped", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-008", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "朱獳", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狐而魚翼，其名曰朱獳，其鳴自訆，見則其國有恐。", "tags": ["body_fox", "self_named_call", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-009", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鵹鶘", "text": "其中多鵹鶘，其狀如鴛鴦而人足，其鳴自訆，見則其國多土功。", "tags": ["body_duck", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-015#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-015", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "獙獙", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狐而有翼，其音如鴻鴈，其名曰獙獙，見則天下大旱。", "tags": ["body_fox", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-016#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-016", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "蠪姪", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狐，而九尾、九首、虎爪，名曰蠪姪，其音如嬰兒，是食人。", "tags": ["body_fox", "heads_many", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "tails_many", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-017#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-017", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "峳峳", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如馬，而羊目、四角、牛尾，其音如獆狗，其名曰峳峳。見則其國多狡客。", "tags": ["body_horse", "horns_four", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-2-017#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-2-017", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "絜鉤", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鳧而鼠尾，善登木，其名曰絜鉤，見則其國多疫。", "tags": ["body_duck", "climber"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-3-001#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-3-001", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "妴胡", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如麋而魚目，名曰妴胡，其鳴自訆。", "tags": ["body_deer", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-3-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-3-007", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鮯鮯之魚", "text": "有魚焉，其狀如鯉，而六足鳥尾，名曰鮯鮯之魚，其鳴自訆。", "tags": ["body_fish", "legs_six", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-3-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-3-008", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "精精", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛而馬尾，名曰精精，其鳴自訆。", "tags": ["body_cattle", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-001#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-001", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鬿雀", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如雞而白首，鼠足而虎爪，其名曰鬿雀，亦食人。", "tags": ["body_fowl", "head_white", "man_eater"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-004#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-004", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "薄魚", "text": "其中多薄魚，其狀如鱣魚而一目，其音如歐，見則天下大旱。", "tags": ["body_fish", "eye_one", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-005", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "當康", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如豚而有牙，其名曰當康，其鳴自叫，見則天下大穰。", "tags": ["body_pig", "self_named_call", "tusks", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-006", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "䱻魚", "text": "其中多䱻魚，其狀如魚而鳥翼，出入有光，其音如鴛鴦，見則天下大旱。", "tags": ["body_fish", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-007", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "合窳", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如彘而人面，黃身而赤尾，其名曰合窳，其音如嬰兒。是獸也，食人，亦食蟲蛇，見則天下大水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_pig", "human_face", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "tail_red", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-04-4-008#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-04-4-008", "book": "東山經", "section": "東次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "蜚", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛而白首，一目而蛇尾，其名曰蜚，行水則竭，行草則死，見則天下大疫。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_cattle", "eye_one", "head_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-1-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-1-003", "book": "中山經", "section": "中山經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "豪魚", "text": "是多豪魚，狀如鮪，而赤喙赤尾赤羽，可以已白癬。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_fish", "tail_red", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-2-004#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-2-004", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "鳴蛇", "text": "其中多鳴蛇，其狀如蛇而四翼，其音如磬，見則其邑大旱。", "tags": ["body_snake", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-2-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-2-005", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "fish", "name_display_only": "化蛇", "text": "其中多化蛇，其狀如人面而豺身，鳥翼而蛇行，其音如叱呼，見則其邑大水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_human", "human_face", "sound_human", "vocal", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-2-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-2-009", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "馬腹", "text": "有獸焉，其名曰馬腹，其狀如人面虎身，其音如嬰兒，是食人。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "body_human", "human_face", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-3-001#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-3-001", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "夫諸", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如白鹿而四角，名曰夫諸，見則其邑大水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_deer", "horns_four"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-3-002#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-3-002", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次三經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鴢", "text": "有鳥焉，名曰鴢，其狀如鳧，青身而朱目赤尾，食之宜子。", "tags": ["blue_green", "body_duck", "tail_red"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-4-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-4-003", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "犀渠", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如牛。蒼身，其音如嬰兒，是食人，其名曰犀渠。", "tags": ["blue_green", "body_cattle", "man_eater", "sound_baby", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-4-003#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-4-003", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次四經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "𤢺", "text": "有獸焉，名曰𤢺，其狀如獳犬而有鱗，其毛如彘鬣。", "tags": ["body_dog", "long_shaggy_hair", "mane", "scales"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-6-003#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-6-003", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次六經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "鴒䳩", "text": "有鳥焉，狀如山雞而長尾，赤如丹火而青喙，名曰鴒䳩，其鳴自呼，服之不眯。交觴之水出于其陽，而南流注于洛；俞隨之水出于其陰，而北流注于穀水。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_fowl", "body_red", "long_tail", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-9-004#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-9-004", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次九經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "竊脂", "text": "有鳥焉，狀如鴞而赤身白首，其名曰竊脂，可以禦火。", "tags": ["body_owl", "body_red", "body_white", "head_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-9-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-9-006", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次九經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "有獸焉", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如狐，而白尾長耳，名𤜣狼，見則國內有兵。", "tags": ["body_fox", "long_tail"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-10-005#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-10-005", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "跂踵", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鴞，而一足彘尾，其名曰跂踵，見則其國大疫。", "tags": ["body_owl", "leg_one"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-11-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-11-006", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十一經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "雍和", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如猨，赤目，赤喙、黃身，名曰雍和，見則國有大恐。神耕父處之，常遊清泠之淵，出入有光，見則其國為敗。有九鍾焉，是知霜鳴。其上多金，其下多榖柞杻橿。", "tags": ["aquatic", "beak_red", "body_ape", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-11-010#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-11-010", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十一經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "嬰勺", "text": "有鳥焉，其名曰嬰勺，其狀如鵲，赤目、赤喙、白身，其尾若勺，其鳴自呼。多㸲牛，多羬羊。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_crow", "body_white", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-11-012#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-11-012", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十一經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "bird", "name_display_only": "青耕", "text": "有鳥焉，其狀如鵲，青身白喙，白目白尾，名曰青耕，可以禦疫，其鳴自叫。", "tags": ["blue_green", "body_crow", "body_white", "self_named_call", "vocal"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-11-035#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-11-035", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十一經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "𤝻即", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如膜犬，赤喙、赤目、白尾，見則其邑有火，名曰𤝻即。", "tags": ["beak_red", "body_dog"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-11-042#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-11-042", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十一經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "梁渠", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如貍而白首虎爪，名曰梁渠，見則其國有大兵。", "tags": ["body_wildcat", "head_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-05-12-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-05-12-009", "book": "中山經", "section": "中次十二經", "layer": "山經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "蛫", "text": "有獸焉，其狀如龜，而白身赤首，名曰蛫，是可以禦火。", "tags": ["body_red", "body_turtle", "body_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-07-1-019#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-07-1-019", "book": "海外西經", "section": "海外西經", "layer": "海外經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "龍魚陵居", "text": "龍魚陵居在其北，狀如狸。一曰鰕。即有神聖乘此以行九野。一曰鼈魚在夭野北，其為魚也如鯉。", "tags": ["body_wildcat", "on_land"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-07-1-020#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-07-1-020", "book": "海外西經", "section": "海外西經", "layer": "海外經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "白民之國", "text": "白民之國在龍魚北，白身披髮。有乘黃，其狀如狐，其背上有角，乘之壽二千歲。", "tags": ["body_fox", "body_white"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-08-1-021#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-08-1-021", "book": "海外北經", "section": "海外北經", "layer": "海外經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "駮", "text": "有獸焉，其名曰駮，狀如白馬，鋸牙，食虎豹。有素獸焉，狀如馬，名曰蛩蛩。有青獸焉，狀如虎，名曰羅羅。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "body_horse", "tusks"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-09-1-012#2", "entry_id": "SHJ-09-1-012", "book": "海外東經", "section": "海外東經", "layer": "海外經", "kind": "snake", "name_display_only": "有赤蛇。", "text": "有赤蛇。一曰在十日北，為人黑身人面，各操一龜。", "tags": ["body_black", "human_face"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-10-1-007#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-10-1-007", "book": "海內南經", "section": "海內南經", "layer": "海內經(四篇)", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "兕", "text": "兕在舜葬東，湘水南，其狀如牛，蒼黑，一角。", "tags": ["aquatic", "body_black", "body_cattle", "horn_one"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-12-1-004#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-12-1-004", "book": "海內北經", "section": "海內北經", "layer": "海內經(四篇)", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "吉量", "text": "犬封國曰犬戎國，狀如犬。有一女子，方跪進柸食。有文馬，縞身朱鬛，目若黃金，名曰吉量，乘之壽千歲。", "tags": ["body_dog", "striped"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-12-1-006#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-12-1-006", "book": "海內北經", "section": "海內北經", "layer": "海內經(四篇)", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "窮奇狀如", "text": "窮奇狀如虎，有翼，食人從首始，所食被髮，在蜪犬北。一曰從足。", "tags": ["body_bigcat", "man_eater", "wings"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-12-1-009#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-12-1-009", "book": "海內北經", "section": "海內北經", "layer": "海內經(四篇)", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "蟜", "text": "蟜，其為人虎文，脛有𦜹。在窮奇東。一曰，狀如人。昆侖虛北所有。", "tags": ["body_human", "striped"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-12-1-012#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-12-1-012", "book": "海內北經", "section": "海內北經", "layer": "海內經(四篇)", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "環狗", "text": "環狗，其為人獸首人身。一曰蝟狀如狗，黃色。", "tags": ["body_dog", "body_human"]}
{"cid": "SHJ-14-1-036#1", "entry_id": "SHJ-14-1-036", "book": "大荒東經", "section": "大荒東經", "layer": "大荒經", "kind": "beast", "name_display_only": "夔", "text": "有獸，狀如牛，蒼身而無角，一足，出入水則必風雨，其光如日月，其聲如雷，其名曰夔。黃帝得之，以其皮為鼓，橛以雷獸之骨，聲聞五百里，以威天下。", "tags": ["aquatic", "blue_green", "body_cattle", "leg_one", "sound_drum"]}
